<view class="container">
  <view class="card intro-card">
    <view class="page-title">🌱 一起发现宝宝的新本领</view>
    <view class="age-text">{{ageText ? '宝宝现在 ' + ageText + ' · 按首页生日计算' : '还未设置宝宝生日'}}</view>
    <view class="intro-text">在日常陪玩中观察，选择最符合实际的结果，可以随时更新。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="month-tabs">
    <button class="month-tab {{selectedMonth === 6 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-month="6" bindtap="selectMonth">6个月清单</button>
    <button class="month-tab {{selectedMonth === 9 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-month="9" bindtap="selectMonth">9个月清单</button>
    <button class="month-tab {{selectedMonth === 12 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-month="12" bindtap="selectMonth">12个月清单</button>
  </view>
  <view class="stage-hint">{{stageHint}}</view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty-tip">正在读取观察记录…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{loadError}}" class="card empty-tip">
    <view>暂时无法读取记录，请稍后重试。</view>
    <button class="btn-secondary" bindtap="loadRecords">重新加载</button>
  </view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="record-summary">已记录 {{recordedCount}} / {{total}} 项 · 点击项目填写</view>
    <button class="summary-button" bindtap="copySummary">复制儿保沟通摘要</button>
    <view wx:if="{{activities.length}}" class="card activity-card">
      <view class="group-title">接下来可以这样玩</view>
      <view class="item-tip">根据当前月龄和已记录的观察匹配，选一个宝宝感兴趣的即可。烦躁或疲倦时暂停、安抚。</view>
      <view wx:for="{{activities}}" wx:key="id" class="activity-item">
        <view class="item-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="activity-reason">{{item.reason}}</view>
        <view class="item-tip">{{item.text}}</view>
        <view class="observation-date">观察方向：{{item.targetTitle}}</view>
        <button class="observe-button" data-id="{{item.milestoneId}}" bindtap="openObservation">记录这次观察</button>
      </view>
      <view class="observation-date">活动依据：CDC {{selectedMonth}}个月亲子活动建议</view>
      <button class="source-button" bindtap="copyActivitySource">复制活动依据链接</button>
    </view>
    <view class="card group-card" wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:for-item="group" wx:key="id">
      <view class="group-title">{{group.title}}</view>
      <view class="milestone-item" wx:for="{{group.items}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openObservation">
        <view class="item-heading">
          <view class="item-title">{{item.title}}</view>
          <text class="status-tag {{item.status || 'unrecorded'}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="item-tip">{{item.tip}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.observedDate}}" class="observation-date">观察日期：{{item.observedDate}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="observation-note">{{item.note}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="card reference-card">
    <view>依据：CDC 发育里程碑清单（中文整理）。这些项目描述多数宝宝在相应月龄会出现的表现。</view>
    <view class="reference-note">清单用于记录和儿保沟通，不能替代专业发育筛查。当前参考月龄的项目若还没观察到，或出现已会技能退步及其他担忧，请带记录咨询儿保医生。</view>
    <button class="source-button" bindtap="copySource">复制 CDC 原文链接</button>
  </view>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{editor}}" class="editor-mask" bindtap="closeEditor">
  <view class="editor-panel" catchtap="stopTap">
    <scroll-view scroll-y class="editor-scroll">
      <view class="editor-title">{{editor.title}}</view>
      <view class="item-tip">{{editor.tip}}</view>
      <view class="status-options">
        <button wx:for="{{statusOptions}}" wx:key="value" class="status-option {{editor.status === item.value ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-status="{{item.value}}" bindtap="selectStatus" disabled="{{saving}}">{{item.label}}</button>
      </view>
      <view class="choice-help">
        <view>还没观察到：已有自然观察机会，尚未见到。</view>
        <view>不确定：记不清、尚无观察机会或暂时无法判断。</view>
      </view>
      <picker mode="date" value="{{editor.observedDate}}" end="{{today}}" bindchange="onDateChange" disabled="{{saving}}">
        <view class="date-field">观察日期 <text>{{editor.observedDate}} ✎</text></view>
      </picker>
      <textarea class="note-input" placeholder="可选：记下当时的情境和宝宝的反应" value="{{editor.note}}" maxlength="300" bindinput="onNoteInput" disabled="{{saving}}" />
      <view class="note-limit">{{editor.note.length}} / 300</view>
    </scroll-view>
    <view class="editor-actions">
      <button class="cancel-button" bindtap="closeEditor" disabled="{{saving}}">取消</button>
      <button class="btn-primary save-button" bindtap="saveObservation" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">保存观察</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
